{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/481079-a-haunting-in-x-share-real-life-hauntings-for-wraith","id":481079,"title":"A Haunting in X: Share real life hauntings for Wraith","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-14T20:41:39-07:00","id":481079,"title":"A Haunting in X: Share real life hauntings for Wraith","content":"the idea of this thread is to share places of myth, legends or real life in which you know theres massive hauntings for a Wraith Game.<br /> <br /> Torre Santa Maria, Santiago de Chile. Saint Marie Tower<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torre_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Torre_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa%2C_Providencia%2C_Santiago_20230311.jpg/960px-Torre_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa%2C_Providencia%2C_Santiago_20230311.jpg?utm_source=es.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torre_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa\" target=\"_blank\"> Torre Santa Mar&iacute;a - Wikipedia, la enciclopedia libre </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torre_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa\" target=\"_blank\"> http://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torre_Santa_Mar%C3%ADa </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> During 14 years, it was the highest tower in chile. Containing a lot of offices within it, having 33 floors and being on the high of Cerro San Cristobal (Saint Cristobal's mountain)<br /> March 21 of 1984, the tenth floor was set on fire due an accident, leaving the floors pretty much disconnected from the rest of the building. The fire department ladders coudnt reach the floor and 11 lives were lost due the fire, the asphyxiation and those who jumped.<br /> To this day the building is haunted by the ghost of a member of the firesquad, whom can be seen on the elevators.<br /> <br /> Subway Line of Los Heroes, Linea del metro Los Heroes.<br /> Theres too much people that has commited suicide on the subways stations of chile, its pretty normal in here (sadly), but theres rumours about a Girl beeing seen on the subway station. its belived that each subway station on Line 5 has at least one ghost per station.<br /> <br /> Cementary Subway Station. Estacion de metro Cementerios.<br /> Next to one of the trainstations, theres a cementary (cementerio general). Theres who claim that the tunnels of the subway connecting to that station are fill with eerie shadows and faces. People appearing and dissapairing inside the subway train (ghosts?) and an spooky sensation all around the construction of that subway line..<br /> <br /> The Haunted House of \u00d1u\u00f1oa.<br /> A mannor fill with suicides and tragedy, its belived that each room had a different haunting going on. on 2005 it was burned to the ground in a Mysterios Event, no one knows how it happend. Over what was left of the structure a shopping mall was built. To this day, strange events go through the mall, power outages, sounds of childs crying or steps and moving objects<br /> <a href=\"http://g.cdn.ecn.cl/fenomenos-paranormales/files/2014/08/casas-embrujadas-santiago-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">http://g.cdn.ecn.cl/fenomenos-parano...santiago-6.jpg</a><b><br /> <br /> <br /> The Salvador Hospital: El Hospital Salvador<br /> <br /> On the metro station of Salvador, we find an old almost victorian hospital. it was home of several illnesses and quarentines, involving Tuberculosis, Cholera and Viruela. Its been said that the main ghosts that you can find (other than the ones of the patients) are the Doctor (a tall thin doctor from the 1900 who walks through the walls) the Two Nuns of Charity ( Two nuns who go out of the building to smoke), The Headless Monk and The Woman in Red (A figure who walks around the maternity area all dressed in red, some belive she helped woman to give birth during the 1910)<br /> <br /> The Ghosts of the 73'<br /> During 1973 to 1990 there was a military Cue de Grae, in which the military took over. Among their structures to control the public, these created Detention camps in which thousands of left winged sympathyzers were tortured and killed. Theres myths of these places still being haunted by those who died to this day. some buildings such as<br /> The National Stadium<br /> Mainly used for concerts and soccer games now a days, during the 73' it was a Detention center in which many were killed and tortured including the artist Victor Jara (a sort of Chilean Bob Dylan), some belive his ghost still lies there, singing in the nights to keep the other apparitions with hope of a better tomorrow.</b><br /> <br /> El Melecot\u00f3<br /> The house of General Pinochet in Cajon del maipo, its belived that the place has a Dark and Strange eerie Energy. currently is beeing used as part of an University, theres those who claim that in the place you can see things breaking up, equipment going missing and sometimes you can hear people stamping on the floors, running, shouting and screaming in pain and agony...<br /> <br /> <br /> Costanera Center<br /> The biggest building in south america so far, host of a massive tower and a shopping center.<br /> Ever since it was build there were strange events sorrounding the structure, builders commiting suicide (by jumping to the elevator shaft), people climbing the tower (which wasnt open to the public) and jumping, and even people jumping inside the Shopping Center to their demisse. The worst part being that chilean people is somehow ignorant and incensitive, whenever they see someone trying to jump or about to jump, they start recording and calling the jumper names like &quot;Come on you pussy, jump-. you fucking coward&quot;.<br /> The place its been host of at least 5 Deaths (which i can remember, not sure if theres been more that havent been disclossed)<br /> <br /> These are some of the places of my land im interested in sharing with you , in case you wanna build your own Haunt or Necropolis around places like these (or modifying them to fit your game)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T10:22:36-07:00","id":481392,"title":"","content":"Afraid the only real-life haunting I have experience with, the <a href=\"http://www.seeing-stars.com/Hotels/HollywoodRoosevelt.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">Hollywood Roosevelt Hotel</a>, probably wasn't impressive enough to build an adventure around. The ghost flipped on a light switch in the maintenance closet across the hall from room #928 a couple of times as I walked down the hall\u2014didn't exactly have me fleeing in fright for the protection of an exorcist. The legends about deceased celebrities that supposedly haunt the place could be used as story background, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"http